<div id="step-photo-permission-container" class="animate-fade-in space-y-3 current-question-container">
  <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
    <div class="bg-neutral-100 p-4 rounded-2xl rounded-tl-none shadow-sm text-neutral-800 max-w-[85%] text-sm">
      ¿Tenés la posibilidad de sacar o subir una foto del animal en este momento? 📸
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2">
        <%= button_to "Sí, puedo", answer_photo_permission_reports_path(can_photo: true, is_edit: local_assigns[:is_edit]), method: :post, class: "bg-white border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-700 font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-neutral-50 shadow-sm" %>
        <%= button_to "No, no puedo", answer_photo_permission_reports_path(can_photo: false, is_edit: local_assigns[:is_edit]), method: :post, class: "bg-white border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-500 text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-neutral-50 shadow-sm" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
